Code.NativeIaC:
```bicep
// Encrypt an Azure AI services account with a customer-managed key
resource account 'Microsoft.CognitiveServices/accounts@2024-10-01' = {
  name: '<example_resource_name>'
  location: '<location>'
  kind: 'OpenAI'
  sku: { name: 'S0' }
  identity: { type: 'SystemAssigned' }
  properties: {
    customSubDomainName: '<example_resource_name>'
    encryption: {
      keySource: 'Microsoft.KeyVault' // CRITICAL: use a customer-managed key
      keyVaultProperties: {
        keyName: '<key_name>'
        keyVaultUri: '<key_vault_uri>'
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Code.Terraform:
```hcl
resource "azurerm_cognitive_account_customer_managed_key" "<example_resource_name>" {
  cognitive_account_id = azurerm_cognitive_account.<example_resource_name>.id
  key_vault_key_id     = azurerm_key_vault_key.<example_resource_name>.id # CRITICAL: use a customer-managed key
}
```
